WEBVTT

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:15.600
It's on me today, so eat all you want.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:20.910
This is a Gokugyu specialty:
 our seasonal super-choice roast.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:24.420
You're young, so eat all you like.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.590
Since you're young...

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:37.090
Hey! You don't need collagen!

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:40.310
I want smooth skin, too!

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:48.190
To the outsider goes the spoils.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:51.760
Eat onions!
 You're a master detective, aren't you?!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:55.610
Here, Tensai. S-Say, "Ahh..."

00:00:56.830 --> 00:01:02.330
A mere assistant, asking me to 
say "ahh"? You forget your place.

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:04.700
You ate it anyway?!

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:08.070
I couldn't resist the 
rich aroma of tender fat.

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:15.470
<i>He's... good.</i>

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:18.070
<i>He looks like a pretty young maid,</i>

00:01:18.070 --> 00:01:20.970
<i>but he's a trap, with an 
Excalibur just like my own!</i>

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:25.350
<i>Can he resist the urge to taste a girl's saliva?</i>

00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:27.290
<i>No, surely not!</i>

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:32.540
Thanks for the meal.

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:34.820
<i>What?!</i>

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:38.110
<i>I was trying to sate the wrong appetite!</i>

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:40.350
Thanks for the meal.

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:46.670
<i>Eh? Did he, or didn't he?</i>

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:27.430
Now, then, I'd like to discuss 
our future activities.

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:27.420
<b><u>Episode 5</u></b>

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:27.420
Mission Impossible

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:31.980
The fact is, I have a lead on a 
place where there may be ruins.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:32.650
Oh?

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:35.730
It's a hot springs town on 
the west side of the island.

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:39.890
I thought we might as well go there 
for an overnight trip next weekend.

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:43.180
Hot springs, huh? That sounds fun!

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:45.160
Yeah. Let's do that.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:46.940
Hot springs...

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:48.730
With Isshin-sama...

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:52.840
How much is this going to cost?

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:56.460
I've already done my max
 allowance of part-time work this month.

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:58.500
You don't need to worry.

00:03:58.160 --> 00:04:00.090
I've waited for this day...

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:01.180
I made a little extra money, so I'll pay.

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:03.990
I'll do anything... and I'll let him do anything.

00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:03.990
For real?! Then I'll go!

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:05.430
We're all in, then.

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:09.500
Oh, Juugo...

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:13.350
We're coming to your place tomorrow,
 so have dinner ready.

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:16.490
What are you saying with a gut like that?

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:17.360
You'll get fat.

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:22.770
You don't know anything!

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:24.410
Master detectives don't get fat!

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:27.030
Don't attach "master 
detective" to everything!

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:30.120
And I'm not making dinner 
for you guys tomorrow!

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:32.950
Your opinion is irrelevant.

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:36.540
Nanana-dono has told us that 
we can visit whenever we like.

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:39.090
Since when are you
 such good friends with her?

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:41.660
Well then, goodnight, Juugo.

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:43.800
Goodnight.

00:04:44.310 --> 00:04:46.560
Yeah, goodnight.

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:48.300
Don't you dare come.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:55.740
So, about the Nanana's Collection
 treasure in this hot springs town...

00:04:55.740 --> 00:04:57.060
Just so you know,

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:59.810
since I gave you a hint last time,
 I won't give more for a while.

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:00.690
What?

00:05:01.180 --> 00:05:03.860
I feel like spoiling you 
will just ruin you,

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:05.150
so I'll be strict.

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:07.110
But...

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:11.310
Still, a hot spring with 
everyone, huh? Sounds nice.

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:14.370
There were no hot
 springs there when I was alive.

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:19.230
Well, I can't leave this room,

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:21.300
so I'll make do with your stories.

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:24.600
So tell me all about it, okay?

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:27.470
You got it.

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:30.850
<i>Still... a hot spring with Nanana-chan...</i>

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:32.170
Concentrate!

00:05:32.170 --> 00:05:33.570
R-Right!

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:37.730
<b>Yukihime</b>

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:37.730
<b>We need to talk.
 Let me know what day is good for you.</b>

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:47.200
You're awfully psyched up.

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:50.410
Yep! Got a date today!

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:52.570
Ooh, nice!

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:55.370
Be sure to escort her properly.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:58.710
Um, aren't you supposed to be jealous or—

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:00.610
Pick up some pudding on your way home!

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:01.520
Right.

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:08.510
Welcome.

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:19.740
Iced lemon tea.

00:06:19.740 --> 00:06:21.150
Certainly.

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:26.740
S-So... to what do I
 owe the pleasure today?

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:28.540
Where exactly are you looking?

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:30.360
Oh... uh... sorry!

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:34.690
If you want to look, then look all you want.

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:36.330
Or...

00:06:37.050 --> 00:06:38.620
Would you rather touch them?

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.570
I-I can?!

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:44.630
Uh...

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:47.720
What is it you want, Shuu-san?

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:50.540
Huh?! How did you know?

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:53.890
Is it because I made the boobs so big?

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:55.970
No.

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:02.610
Let's try this again.

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:04.280
Long time no see, Young Master.

00:07:04.810 --> 00:07:07.110
Thanks for your help the other day.

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:09.540
We just happened to share a common interest.

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:14.700
So, when will you be returning to Matsuri?

00:07:16.340 --> 00:07:17.410
I'm not.

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:21.370
Then you won't be needing
 this allowance anymore, correct?

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:25.830
A disowned son accepting
 an allowance from his father...

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:28.380
It appears to me that
 you're treating life as a joke.

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:30.590
I'll be keeping all of this for myself.

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:33.190
Wait! That's embezzlement!

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:35.240
So it is. Your point?

00:07:36.460 --> 00:07:37.550
Um...

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:40.600
Fine. Take it.

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:43.990
You really are stubborn.

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:46.980
Let me ask you one question.

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:50.570
Why are you searching 
for Nanana's Collection?

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:52.820
That's a secret.

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:56.730
Matsuri shares your goal. 
Did it not occur to you

00:07:56.730 --> 00:08:00.180
that returning to us would give 
you a greater chance of success?

00:08:00.180 --> 00:08:02.830
Don't talk to me like I'm an idiot!

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:04.290
I'm aware of that!

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:06.670
Then why won't you come back?

00:08:07.610 --> 00:08:10.510
Because I can't approve 
of Matsuri's intentions.

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:13.220
What do you mean?

00:08:13.610 --> 00:08:17.310
I have no interest whatsoever in 
just doing things to help people.

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:21.260
And were you disowned
 because you told the boss that?

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:22.180
That's right.

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:26.940
You've gained quite the
 impudent attitude since I last saw you.

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:30.940
I always felt that way.
 I just hadn't said it before.

00:08:31.880 --> 00:08:34.800
I will beat those rotten 
ideals of yours into shape.

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:38.910
Promise me here and now
 that you will return to Matsuri.

00:08:39.150 --> 00:08:40.160
I refuse.

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:41.410
Return.

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:43.040
I told you, I refuse!

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:44.250
Return!

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:46.620
I absolutely refuse!

00:08:52.910 --> 00:08:55.180
What am I to you, Young Master?

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:57.640
What?

00:08:58.210 --> 00:09:03.100
What do you, Yama Juugo,
 think that I, Fugi Yukihime, am?

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:05.570
Well, um...

00:09:05.570 --> 00:09:09.930
Sort of an older sister 
who's helped me out a lot.

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:12.570
That will be enough.

00:09:13.260 --> 00:09:15.030
This discussion is over.

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:17.010
I never want to see your face again.

00:09:23.150 --> 00:09:24.330
I'm home.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:25.710
Welcome back!

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:27.740
What are you people doing?!

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:29.520
It's a gaming party!

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:31.210
Here.

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:33.710
I'm here for your utility payment.

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:38.720
Is it supposed to cost this much?!

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:40.680
<b>Gas                           3978 yen</b>

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:40.680
<b>Electricity             15765 yen</b>

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:40.680
<b>Water                        2340 yen</b>

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:40.680
Especially the electricity!

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:45.180
Probably because there's a girl 
living here who plays games 24/7.

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:49.600
Honestly, Juugo, thanks
 to all these games you buy,

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:52.650
I'm busy playing online 
and console games all day!

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:56.240
Uh, landlady, listen...

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:58.360
I'm a little tight this month...

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:02.330
I'll need the money by this weekend,
 or you'll be evicted immediately.

00:10:04.550 --> 00:10:06.980
Nowhere near enough...

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:08.750
That still wasn't high enough?

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:12.210
Could you go from the ground?

00:10:13.060 --> 00:10:14.170
There!

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:18.840
You died.

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:39.950
Yuiga-senpai, the third-year,
 told me about you.

00:10:40.730 --> 00:10:44.700
Um, he said you could help
 me find part-time work in secret.

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:47.710
Oh, you're Yama-kun?
 I've heard about you.

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:51.340
I'm Sanada Hajiki.
 Second-year, like you.

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:55.310
Welcome to the Guild,
 an affiliate of Third High School.

00:10:55.310 --> 00:10:57.960
Are these all secret job offers?

00:10:57.960 --> 00:11:01.590
Yep. You can't make enough
 money in the fixed amount of time

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:02.850
the island allows for work.

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:05.600
The Guild is here to respond to that need.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:09.810
Well, if you find one that 
interests you, bring it to me.

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:11.060
Okay. Thanks.

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:16.280
<b>Job Offer</b>

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:16.280
<b>Employer: Maboro Shiki
Place: Happy House in the South Sector</b>

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:16.280
<b>Description: Yardwork, shopping, odd jobs
 (beer, and beer, and beer...)
  Hiring: 1  Qualifications: None
Pay: Negotiable. Bonuses included♥</b>

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:16.280
<b>Time Frame: 1-3 months, 2 days per week
  Hours: A few hours in the evenings</b>

00:11:20.050 --> 00:11:23.320
<i>Urgent transport of goods 
to the Tsukuyomi District...</i>

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:28.290
<b>Job Offer  
Employer: Hanako  
Location: East Third Sector, Second Harbor, 25th warehouse  
Description: Urgent Transport of goods to the Ninth District  
Hiring: 1  
Qualifications: None  
Compensation: 8,000 yen  
Time Frame: One day, the 16th  
Hours: 2:00-4:00 PM  
Notes: Must be able to keep a secret.</b>

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:27.350
<i>The time frame is
 tomorrow from 2:00 to 4:00...</i>

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:28.290
<i>8,000 yen?!</i>

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:29.910
<i>This looks good!</i>

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:35.000
<i>Black pigtails!</i>

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:38.440
May this job lead to criminal acts...

00:11:39.430 --> 00:11:41.160
You're... Tensai?!

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:44.250
As the rival of a master detective,

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:46.970
I need you to turn down the path of evil.

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:49.270
What's with the black hair?

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:51.860
Disguise is a fundamental
 skill for master detectives.

00:11:51.860 --> 00:11:52.940
Looks good on me, right?

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:56.100
You look normal, I guess.

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:59.390
On the inside,
you're thinking it's not half bad.

00:11:59.390 --> 00:12:01.400
Yeah, if only it wasn't you wearing it.

00:12:02.690 --> 00:12:04.620
Why don't you look me 
in the eye and say that?

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:06.120
Look, look!

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:07.370
Look, look!

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:08.760
Look, look!

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:08.760
Cut it out!

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:10.440
Hey, guys...

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:12.620
Could you save that for outside?

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:17.590
Anyway, are you trying
 to pay your utility bill, too?

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:20.590
I'm not particularly hurting for money.

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:25.750
I was just looking for interesting cases.

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:26.970
<b>Job Offer</b>

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:26.970
<b>Employer: Suruga Aya
Location: Nanae Island
Description: Search for a missing person</b>

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:36.270
<i>Where the hell am I?</i>

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:40.130
<i>What the hell is this?</i>

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:50.670
<i>Damn Tensai,
 putting that weird curse on me...</i>

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:52.000
Huh? Young Master?

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:55.660
Shuu-san!

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:59.500
You really saved me.

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:03.970
It's fine. I'm just glad 
I could be of use to you.

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:07.380
I didn't know there was a
 place like this on Nanae Island.

00:13:07.380 --> 00:13:09.650
The Ninth District of Nanae Island...

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:11.180
Known as the Tsukuyomi District.

00:13:11.550 --> 00:13:14.770
A lawless district where the black 
sheep of the island come together.

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:19.180
The police won't touch it...
In fact, they silently condone it.

00:13:21.010 --> 00:13:23.000
Why are you here, Shuu-san?

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:25.040
To buy some tools for work.

00:13:25.040 --> 00:13:29.490
The organization that governs this 
town has its own smuggling route.

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:30.750
Smuggling?

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:36.090
By the way, remember the 
Nanana's Collection treasure

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:38.490
you returned to us recently?

00:13:38.490 --> 00:13:39.840
The blue jewel.

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:42.080
Huh? Uh, yeah.

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:44.690
Apparently, it was a fake.

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:46.710
What? It was?

00:13:46.710 --> 00:13:51.100
And the boss said that
 you were responsible for it.

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:54.270
Man, my dad's harsh...

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:56.560
Then Yukihime said...

00:13:56.970 --> 00:14:03.530
"Boss, I trust you, but I trust 
the young master just as much."

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:10.240
It was the first time I ever saw 
Yukihime chastise the boss for real.

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:15.220
Whoa, what's wrong with you?

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:20.450
Sorry... I guess a ton of
 dust suddenly got into my eyes...

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:24.340
You're happy that Yukihime 
stood up for you, aren't you?

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:29.300
No... I'm just stunned at the 
shortness of my own human nature.

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:35.110
So, Young Master. It's a bit late 
to ask now, but what's inside that?

00:14:35.110 --> 00:14:36.190
Want to see?

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:45.190
No, that's oka—

00:14:45.840 --> 00:14:47.510
Now you're an accomplice.

00:14:47.510 --> 00:14:49.000
I have no part in this!

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.110
I'm going home!

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.970
Don't leave me alone!

00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:54.620
Hearing that from another
 guy doesn't make me happy!

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:57.640
Here. This is the place.

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:01.580
This is way too cliché...

00:15:06.360 --> 00:15:09.530
Bye, Young Master!
 If you survive, let's meet up again!

00:15:09.530 --> 00:15:11.410
Shuu-san!

00:15:17.740 --> 00:15:20.350
Hey, Tetsu!

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:25.400
The delivery guy's here.

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:31.870
Come in.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.790
<b>Stop</b>

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:46.170
That's a Japanese sword, isn't it?

00:15:48.430 --> 00:15:53.090
Oh, I was just wondering if it... was real...

00:15:53.540 --> 00:15:55.520
You don't need to know.

00:15:58.160 --> 00:16:00.340
Sister, excuse me.

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:16.170
Huh? You're the employer?

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:18.180
Wh-Who the hell are you?!

00:16:18.180 --> 00:16:19.240
Er...

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:22.920
Yun, where is Sister?

00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:30.190
Sister is busy!

00:16:30.190 --> 00:16:32.900
She said to have the 
delivery boy wait for her!

00:16:33.310 --> 00:16:35.890
You heard her. Wait here.

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:38.100
Got it.

00:16:45.990 --> 00:16:47.690
Hey! Keep still!

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:50.820
Um... Yun-chan, was it?

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:52.390
Wh-What are you glaring for?!

00:16:52.390 --> 00:16:54.450
I-I-I'm not scared of you!

00:16:54.790 --> 00:16:56.270
Hey, that's rude.

00:16:56.270 --> 00:16:58.160
This is just how I look.

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:13.300
I'm sorry. I took my joke too far.

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:16.760
H-Hey, delivery boy!

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:19.470
You can't touch
 things without permission!

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:20.970
Right, right.

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:23.260
S-Seriously, you better watch it!

00:17:23.260 --> 00:17:25.820
Sister is the don of Tsukuyomi, 
and she's super bad

00:17:25.820 --> 00:17:28.190
and super cool and super scary!

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:33.510
This is...

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:36.410
Did you find something
 that interests you?

00:17:43.270 --> 00:17:44.460
Where is the item?

00:17:58.420 --> 00:18:01.600
What's your problem? You okay?

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:03.300
Y-Yes!

00:18:03.300 --> 00:18:05.140
Um, here it is!

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:07.370
You didn't look inside, did you?

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:09.060
I only brought it here.

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:15.990
Have you heard of Nanana's Collection?

00:18:16.710 --> 00:18:18.240
No...

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:22.950
They're treasures said to be 
hidden all over Nanae Island.

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:26.950
They're said to possess special powers.

00:18:28.490 --> 00:18:31.450
For instance, this is the 
Arrow of Heaven's Will.

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:33.340
It points only to the truth,

00:18:33.760 --> 00:18:36.010
and pierces the hearts of liars!

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:47.010
Huh?

00:18:51.010 --> 00:18:53.340
Why did he just jump with all his might?

00:18:53.340 --> 00:18:54.690
Idiot! What a total idiot!

00:18:55.850 --> 00:18:57.780
You're just like a little kid!

00:18:58.490 --> 00:19:01.660
Don't mind her. She fools me often, as well.

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:05.300
I can't believe you took that seriously.

00:19:05.300 --> 00:19:08.040
Yeah, you really had me fooled.

00:19:08.740 --> 00:19:12.920
It's almost as if you knew that 
Nanana's Collection really exists.

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:16.970
N-No, I'm just a coward, really...

00:19:16.970 --> 00:19:19.210
And a liar.

00:19:19.210 --> 00:19:23.180
Oh, no, that was...
 I told a lie at school today.

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:27.150
I thought I'd be late for this job,
 so I wanted to leave early...

00:19:27.150 --> 00:19:28.510
Is that so?

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:30.940
Thanks for your effort.

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:35.650
Are you hungry?

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:38.030
I'll use this to make you a tasty cake.

00:19:38.680 --> 00:19:40.470
What, it's just flour?

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:44.030
This is no ordinary flour!

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:47.490
This is three-star pâtisserie flour 
so unique, it never leaves the store!

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:50.960
You told two lies.

00:19:54.260 --> 00:19:55.750
It's a raid!

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:01.180
Damn it!

00:20:01.460 --> 00:20:04.430
Hey, Tetsu! Get him out of 
here through the back door!

00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:07.110
Yun, stay right there!

00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:13.310
Come back to have cake sometime.

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:24.710
Leave while you can, delivery boy.

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:26.100
Yama Juugo.

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:27.660
What's that?

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:29.500
My name.

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:31.370
Give my regards to Yun-chan.

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:35.330
I won't be doing that.
 Your "regards" end with me.

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:37.650
You sure are possessive.

00:20:38.180 --> 00:20:39.630
Later, Tetsu-kun.

00:20:52.420 --> 00:20:55.370
I never got my money for that job...

00:20:57.050 --> 00:20:59.030
Can't you go get it tomorrow?

00:20:59.030 --> 00:21:00.780
No way.

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:02.800
That lady they called "Sister"...

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:04.890
She's real bad news.

00:21:04.890 --> 00:21:07.040
I don't want to get mixed up with her again.

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:10.790
But what will you
 do about the utility bill?

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:12.750
Good question...

00:21:13.360 --> 00:21:15.560
I scraped together all the cash I have,

00:21:15.560 --> 00:21:17.690
but I'm still 3,000 yen short.

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:20.960
So... sorry, Nanana-chan.
